<li><a class="text-accent-700 underline" href="https://www.knx.org/news/knx-awards-2026-celebrate-people-and-projects-shaping-future-smart-buildings" target="_blank" rel="noopener">KNX Association — KNX Awards winners, 06.10.2026</a></li>
